// Trading: BetterRuins gives vanilla's luxuries and agriculture traders dialogues with its map
// quests (patches/others/trader/dialogue in BetterRuins); the pack's curio dealer and farmer, which
// take over those trades, get them the same way. "*" is moved past the new keys, since the game
// takes the first key that matches. Those two dialogues are BetterRuins' copies of the game's trader
// dialogue, so they also get what the pack's own (config/dialogue/trader.json, made by
// Trading/tools/make_entities.py) adds to it: the standing option second in the main menu
// (component 20, "main", in BetterRuins 0.6.4's both files) and its answer. An Atlas scenario
// (TradingWindowScenarios) checks that every pack trader's dialogue has them.
[
